      "kind": "instant_insight",
      "body": [
        {
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "When he calls out to Me, I will answer him. עִמּוֹ אָנֹכִי בְּצָרָה—I will be with him in his pain. When you cry out to Hashem when you are suffering, the person who is sincerely close to Hashem will realize that His response is: עִמּוֹ אָנֹכִי בְּצָרָה—I am right there with you! It is Hashem Who gave you that suffering for your benefit! That is truly the greatest comfort!"
            }
          ]
        }
